42	860,305,1755,628	Fig. 42. Right stirrup: seen, *A* from within, *B* from front, *C* from behind. B foot. cp, head or capitulum. a Front, p back limb.	Three views of the stirrup at four times natural size: A its oval foot-plate from within, B from the front with head cp, front limb a and back limb p, and C from behind as an open stirrup shape.
